notes: |
  Two regressions caused by wavecode-transport-always-visible moving
  .app-controls-row to position:fixed (z-sheet+12 = 52). The fixed
  transport row was rendered on top of the in-flow PresetRow, hiding
  the composition <select>. Toast stack sat at top:calc(--header-h +
  space), pinned under the toolbar.

  Fix:
    - .app-preset-row → position:fixed; top:var(--header-h);
      z-index:calc(var(--z-sheet) + 13) = 53.
    - .app-controls-row → top:calc(var(--header-h) +
      var(--preset-row-h)) (sits below preset row).
    - .app-body padding-top → calc(var(--preset-row-h) +
      var(--controls-h)) = 44 + 52 = 96px (keeps CodeMirror below
      both fixed rows).
    - .toast-stack → top:var(--safe-top) (overlays TopBar visually;
      z-toast=50 > topbar z=45, pointer-events:none on stack
      preserves TopBar clickability around the chip).
    - tokens.css: new --preset-row-h: 44px.

  Counts:
    - components.css: +37 / -9 lines
    - tokens.css:     +1 line (--preset-row-h)
    - packet.md:      +201 lines (new math/wavecode-preset-row-and-toast-z/packet.md)

  Verification:
    - typecheck (tsc --noEmit): clean
    - vitest: 694/694 pass (no test changes — pure CSS)
    - build (vite): success, 8.79s
    - manual visual (logical): TopBar (56) → preset-row (44) →
      transport (52) → app-body (96 reserved) = stacks correctly.
      Toast at top:safe-top overlays TopBar at any toast push
      (e.g. samples-loaded event).
